{"ID":"20240314091757-hm7tcbt","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091757-hm7tcbt","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091757-hm7tcbt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171252-aoj44xu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171252-290h8j2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:752,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171252-290h8j2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:114,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:114\u0026#125;","title":"【竹叶汤】\u0026amp;【竹皮大丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171252-aoj44xu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-aoj44xu","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产后中风发热，面正赤，喘而头痛，竹叶汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-8os4yly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-8os4yly","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"竹叶汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-ig15e7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-ig15e7e","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"竹叶一把葛根三两防风桔梗桂枝人参甘草各一两附子一枚炮生姜五两大枣十五枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-k1mbv6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-k1mbv6l","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右十味，以水一斗，煑取二升半，分温三服，覆使汗出，颈项强,用大附子一枚，破之如豆大，前药扬去沫。呕者加半夏半升洗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-v6tylzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-v6tylzn","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着下来呢，这是另外一种，这个太太生产了以后呢，有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中风发热，面正赤，喘而头痛者..."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脸上的颜色呢，是胃气的颜色，如果是红色的，代表胃气上冲啊！胃气往上冲，所以冲上来以后，会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"喘而头痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-rh8p97h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-rh8p97h","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以这个胃热呢，它没有办法呆在胃里面，往上逆，这时候两个眼睛是红色的，所以你走路上面，一看到那个人脸很红，两颧的地方红，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃经嘛通到承泣，四白，巨髎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，两颧位置看到是红色的，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白虎汤证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-s6du13r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-s6du13r","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果是刚生完小孩的太太，你不要给她吃白虎汤啊！因为她是虚热上来，不是实热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们实热是要白虎汤。妇人虚热也会面赤，也会有脸红，那这虚热的脸红跟实热的脸红有差异，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实热的脸红是赤红的，很亮，虚热的脸红是粉红的，没有什么光亮的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我们用竹叶，葛根，防风，桔梗，桂枝，人参，甘草，附子，你看还用到附子，对不对，因为虚热的脸红。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-yn8bfq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-yn8bfq4","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹叶汤呢，你看有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葛根预防他有刚痉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为有中风嘛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防风呢是通利三焦的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们方剂书上写得很清楚。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么要用桔梗？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为这个生完小孩的妇人呢，都有虚热，有的是实热，我们用承气汤，像这个讲的是虚热，那都会带有一点湿。因为湿有流汗嘛。所以会用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桔梗来排痰排湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-mx74bq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-mx74bq0","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方用的也蛮多的，很多太太也会有这种现象。一般来说，你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只要用到这个炮附子，一般来说，手脚都是冰冷的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以你如果说你不知道她虚热还是实热，你可以问她，你这个身体常常头痛呀？这个头痛不是很严重的头痛，轻微的喘，你问这个刚生完小孩子的太太，“请问你口渴是想喝这个热的水还是温的水”？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“我喜欢喝温的水”，白虎汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“我喜欢喝热的水”，那就是竹叶汤，代表胃是冷的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"视频这里倪师应该是口误了，说喜欢热水是白虎汤，竹叶汤反之，已修正"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-qkumxxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-qkumxxs","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人体的反应很奇怪，里面是冷的时候，他就想去喝热的，里面是热的时候，就会想去喝冷的。所以你外症表面上看的时候，你以为是热的，但实际上是假的热。所以我们会问病人口渴不渴，尤其是胃方面的，很明确的可以知道。那么一般"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚热的人呢都是喜欢喝热的，实热的人呢都是喜欢喝冰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-klepvyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-klepvyh","updated":"20240422171252"}},{"ID":"20240422171252-6llm2o8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-6llm2o8","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人乳中虚，烦乱呕逆，安中益气，竹皮大丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-r8tz9j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-r8tz9j4","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"竹皮大丸方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-u1sp511","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-u1sp511","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"生竹茹石膏各二分桂枝白薇各一分甘草七分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-oguhbdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-oguhbdb","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，末之，枣肉和丸弹子大，饮服一丸，日三夜二服。有热倍白薇，烦喘者加枳实一分。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-qlds9ij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-qlds9ij","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个竹皮大丸呢，在经方里面是很有名的一个处方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"专门给生完小孩的太太，在喂母乳有虚烦现象的时候用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-7ws2huv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-7ws2huv","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"产生虚烦的原因是什么？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如说这个妈妈，她的奶水今天产生一升，可这个 BABY 呢要喝三升，就是你的产奶的量没有办法应付你的小 BABY，或者是你生个双胞胎，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"奶水不够，这个时候呢就是竹皮大丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这种症状，因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乳中虚"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呀，身体虚呀，所以排乳量不够啊！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚你就心里想，奶水不够"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"烦乱呕逆，安中益气"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"竹茹，石膏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看只用一点哦（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"二分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝，白薇还有甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个是粉末，用粉来做。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-ea6sytm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-ea6sytm","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白薇呢，专门是入阳明经的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。病人虚弱的时候，经方呢用桂枝甘草，因为辛甘发散为阳，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白薇呢是阳明经虚热时用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那生竹茹呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"竹茹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是我常常用在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴，糖尿病的时候我也会用竹茹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个竹茹很好用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在三焦系统，淋巴系统，我们的腮腺肿起来，甲状腺肿起来，这个淋巴腺肿起来都可以使用到竹茹。那乳房的硬块也可以用到竹茹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以竹茹呢，能通利三焦，竹茹能够去他的湿，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"类似防己"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-4ilsz1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-4ilsz1m","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那一般我们遇到太太生完小孩以后奶水不够的情况，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可以让病人多吃一点鱼，鱼能够补这个奶水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你也可以用一些这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四物汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如说当归，川芎，芍药，熟地加一些那个四君子，用八珍汤，比如说用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人参白术茯苓甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那如果你用这些药再炖些老母鸡吃，或者我们之前的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归生姜羊肉汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那当归生姜羊肉汤也会补血，也会补到这个奶水。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-97alyyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-97alyyb","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你用中药把奶水补足了以后，等到你喂了一年或者一年半母乳，决心要断奶的时候，如果说你今天没有吃断奶的药，你用西医的退奶针打，西医不知道心脏在管奶水，我们有很好的退奶处方。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果你断奶的时候能处理的很好，可以预防这位太太将来得到乳癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有七种癌症，后面等到，那这是从临床上看的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-869npc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-869npc1","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医的观念里面认为说心脏是管奶水，管月经的。所以在你决定停止喂母乳的两个礼拜，这两个礼拜没有生过小孩的不知道，我当然不知道，但是我看过，这个痛到那个乳头都会发炎，因为奶水不断的出来，那又不能继续喂呀，你如果一直喂小孩子你的月经就不会来。有的女孩子呢，在喂母乳的期间有月经的，很少，绝大多数喂奶期间是没有月经的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-5ye7ixs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-5ye7ixs","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们来处理她的时候我们会用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炒麦芽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小麦的芽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当归四物汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炒麦芽五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归两钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"川芎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，2-3-3-2，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"熟地"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这个处方吃下去以后，奶水就往下走了，很快月经就来了，只要月经一来，胸部的压力就没了，所以做妈妈的最了解女人的奶水就是月经，那西医不了解这个。同样的处方，你现在碰到这个太太，她没有生小孩呀，她就是乳房痛，胸部痛，担心是乳癌，因为有硬块。同样的处方，你可以加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"竹茹三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就这个处方，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防己"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）通利三焦到乳房去，那我们的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"紫根三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用咸来软坚，这种情形。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-f5mbves","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-f5mbves","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果你用瓦楞子，我前面介绍过给大家，瓦楞子这个药呢，是配祛痰水、痰饮或痰积。那停在这个三焦里面的奶水都是属于湿痰，所以我们用瓦楞子去掉。这个处方下去...那你不要去做什么 maymori ，就是压那个乳房检查什么乳癌呀，西医是这样，他把你的乳房压的很扁，然后用很长的针戳进去，叫做needlebiotics，那如果你是我的敌人，我立马叫你去做。那如果你不是我的敌人，不要做，不需要，你就吃这个把它清出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171252-290h8j2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171252-290h8j2","updated":"20240422171252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人吃这个药的时候，乳房胸部会开始动，会刺痛，然后硬块会慢慢缩小，速度很快呀。同时呢，要病人心情开朗，保持着很好的心情，不要去想太多。那你生完小孩以后要退奶也可以用，还有平常胸部有硬块都可以使用。这是可以预防病人得到乳癌的处方。"}]}]}